# NeuroNexus Buzsaki64sp — neurosuite-3 probe configuration
# Catalog page 105
# 1 shank, 64 sites/shank, 64 total channels
# Geometry fully enumerated: all 64 sites as [x_um, y_um]
#   x = lateral position from first shank tip (µm)
#   y = depth from shank tip (µm); sites ordered tip-to-base
